(text "SWITCHES (internal pull-ups)" (at 170.18 218.44 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 4634b447-2bb0-4965-953a-9393a0f11f71))
(text "OPERATOR INPUTS (RC-filtered ADC)" (at 20.32 139.7 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 8b7bb58f-2b28-44ba-8550-3aa8f8363a23))
(text "RESEARCH ONLY: NOT SAFE TO BUILD AS DRAWN. Not built, tested, measured or safety-assessed; a barrier drawn here is not proof of isolation." (at 20.32 258.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 485b10af-5428-42b2-8ad4-81eab2882aeb))
(text "NOTES. A concept drawn by Claude at Bob Drzyzgula's direction, October 2026: not built, not tested, values not checked." (at 20.32 261.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 3482fcca-3788-424b-894e-345765727429))
(text "1. After Freescale AN1662: zero-cross interrupt sets a timer alarm (or a PIO program); at the firing delay a ~100 us gate pulse fires the" (at 20.32 263.40000000000003 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid bc6e8cad-ce57-4084-ac20-3922a814a63c))
(text "   triac; hand-wheel period from edge timestamps; speed loop every half-cycle (120 Hz); stall watchdog. Added: isolation, relay, inputs." (at 20.32 265.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid e9b85e26-e755-4ffa-b440-a6d90d190603))
(text "2. Pins (RP2350B): FIRE GP4; RELAY GP5; ZC GP6; HALL (index) GP7; ENC_A/B GP2/GP3 (PIO counter); STITCH GP10; HEEL GP11; NEEDLE GP12;" (at 20.32 268.20000000000005 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid a97f12f4-cd48-4d30-bf6e-03f8442f8c05))
(text "   knee, pedal, FSR, limit on ADC0-3 (GP40-43); ISENSE ADC4; ADC5-7 spare; GP8/GP9 UART1 for debug (or USB serial). Avoid GP0, GP23, GP25 (PSRAM, key, LED)." (at 20.32 270.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 44bd87ee-d1f7-4db8-b202-8cd971137627))
(text "3. PS1 feeds VSYS through D2, so USB and PS1 may both be connected. Until a built board's isolation is checked, unplug the mains before USB or SWD. Drive GP4 at 8-12 mA." (at 20.32 273.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid eba54bbc-44fb-46ee-b437-bd17672819c1))
(text "4. Fire only after a zero-cross has been seen and the command is zero; close K1 last and open it first; if zero-crosses stop, stop firing and open K1. Never scope the line side." (at 20.32 275.40000000000003 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 9e535d26-e588-47c5-80f5-b36a67605d20))
(text "5. R7/R8: ~3.9 mA peak in the H11AA1; R11: ~8 mA into U3 from 3.3 V; R6/C2 fitted only if a snubberless triac false-fires. T1 optional: the bridge's AC lead through its window, 0.1 V/A about 1.65 V." (at 20.32 277.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid ce0699ed-8d1d-4dce-8dc7-18fc656a1c86))
(text "6. On a WeAct RP2350B Core board, feed PS1 to the 5V pin: the board has its own diode from USB VBUS, so D2 may be left out." (at 20.32 280.20000000000005 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid a495ff66-f687-4d13-a876-d44811261d09))
(text "7. Heel: momentary switch to GND in either pedal (J5 pin 4, J6 pin 3); a heel tap sends the needle to its other stop." (at 20.32 282.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 63719ddf-3fdf-47ae-98a6-f7e3d4a648fd))
(text "8. Encoder U5/U6 (ring of alternating magnets) optional: stops taught and landed by angle; 5-wire cable (3V3, GND, index, A, B)." (at 20.32 285.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid a6546999-98da-452c-8a06-aca07556e587))
(text "9. RECTIFIED-DC VARIANT: BR1 turns the triac's output into DC; D3 carries the motor's current between firings. J3 is the motor's own keyed" (at 20.32 287.40000000000003 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid c7e323f7-6462-466b-a6ce-9e0efbded91f))
(text "   connector (or the leads pass through and are hardwired), never a mains outlet, and is at line potential. T1 sits on the AC side: a CT can't sense DC." (at 20.32 289.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid b7deda90-8041-4a54-abf4-73a3e4bef2ea))
